title mmWave Radar: the real small panels (6.1 px/mm: zero8 at 480x320 and upright at 320x480): every page
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 608
env MMWAVE_DEMO three
env MMWAVE_TEST_CONFIG 1

wait 12000
shot radar
check radar
key 2
wait 500
shot table
check table
key 3
wait 500
shot graph
check graph
key 4
wait 500
shot sensor
check sensor
expect noquit
